[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2799030527","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105290#issuecomment-2799030527","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105290","id":2799030527,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6m1dD_","user":{"login":"jrouwe","id":1621693,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjE2OTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1621693?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe","html_url":"https://github.com/jrouwe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-12T20:37:02Z","updated_at":"2025-04-12T20:37:02Z","body":"This is to be expected with the kind of solver that Jolt (and godot physics too) uses. High mass differences result in artifacts. You can 'fix' it by increasing the number of solver iterations:\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2a7b7ba8-bd97-49bd-9370-7d3396cfb96d)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2799030527/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2800109047","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105290#issuecomment-2800109047","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105290","id":2800109047,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6m5kX3","user":{"login":"yahkr","id":62478788,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyNDc4Nzg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62478788?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahkr","html_url":"https://github.com/yahkr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahkr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahkr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahkr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahkr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahkr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahkr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahkr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahkr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahkr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-13T20:22:15Z","updated_at":"2025-04-13T20:22:15Z","body":"@jrouwe  yeah you're right about the mass difference exacerbating the issue. I think though I attributed too much to that difference vs the axis locking feature. I fear the axis lock is the primary factor in this.\n\nMy use case: a rigid-body player pushing a rigid-body into a wall. The resulting collision is very very jittery and my player easily tunnels into the box, with or without a mass difference. And my player is velocity driven not kinematic. I would expect there must be a solution to a setup like this as it seems rather basic. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2800109047/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2810560305","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105290#issuecomment-2810560305","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105290","id":2810560305,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6nhb8x","user":{"login":"jrouwe","id":1621693,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjE2OTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1621693?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe","html_url":"https://github.com/jrouwe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-16T19:29:54Z","updated_at":"2025-04-16T19:29:54Z","body":"If I update your MRP to set the mass of the capsules to 1 kg, then I don't see any penetration. I would need some sort of repro to investigate this. Note that, unless I find some sort of bug, it is unlikely that the solver can be tweaked to behave differently in this situation (except for increasing simulation frequency / increasing the number of solver iterations).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2810560305/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2814222143","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105290#issuecomment-2814222143","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105290","id":2814222143,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6nvZ8_","user":{"login":"yahkr","id":62478788,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyNDc4Nzg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62478788?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahkr","html_url":"https://github.com/yahkr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahkr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahkr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahkr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahkr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahkr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahkr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahkr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahkr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahkr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-17T23:59:13Z","updated_at":"2025-04-17T23:59:13Z","body":"> If I update your MRP to set the mass of the capsules to 1 kg, then I don't see any penetration. I would need some sort of repro to investigate this. Note that, unless I find some sort of bug, it is unlikely that the solver can be tweaked to behave differently in this situation (except for increasing simulation frequency / increasing the number of solver iterations).\n\nVery fair and I appreciate you taking the time to look at this.  I think I was just surprised that a 25kg difference would cause such artifacts.  I'll just have to explore scaling the masses of my objects down until the collisions feel right.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2814222143/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]